flowchart TD
  A[Request or Domain Event] --> B[Flask Blueprint / Event Consumer]
  B --> C[Schema Validation]
  C --> D[Authentication, Tenant and Permission Check]
  D --> E[Domain Service]
  E --> F[Scoped Repository / PostgreSQL]
  F --> G[Audit + Transactional Outbox]
  G --> H[Celery Worker if asynchronous]
  H --> I[Persist Result and Emit Event]
  I --> J[UI Status / Report / Next Workflow]
